ativity cannot be changed.The number of operands required by an operator cannot be changed.Operators cannot be overloaded only for built-in types.Some operators can only be overloaded as member functions.Operator Functions vs Normal FunctionsFeatureOperator FunctionNormal FunctionSyntaxUses operator keywordStandard function nameInvocationTriggered by using an operatorCalled explicitly by namePurposeRedefines behavior of operatorsPerforms defined actionsExampleoperator+()add()
